@startuml
title NestJS Routes — validação HTTP e exclusão desabilitada (v1.2.0)
actor "Cliente" as Client
participant "RoutesController" as Ctl
participant "RoutesDriverService" as Tracker
participant "RoutesService" as Routes
database "Prisma MongoDB" as Prisma
participant "WebSocket gateway" as WS
Client -> Ctl : POST /routes/{id}/process-route (lat, lng)
Ctl -> Tracker : processRoute(route_id,lat,lng)
Tracker -> Tracker : validar id string não vazio,
latitude [-90,90], longitude [-180,180], finitos
alt entrada inválida
 Tracker --> Client : HTTP 400 BadRequestException
else dados válidos
 Tracker -> Prisma : upsert RouteDriver
 Prisma --> Tracker : registro salvo
 Tracker -> WS : emitNewPoints
 Tracker --> Client : resposta RouteDriver
end
Client -> Ctl : DELETE /routes/{id}
Ctl -> Routes : remove(id string)
Routes --> Client : HTTP 501 NotImplementedException
note bottom
DELETE não altera banco nem anuncia exclusão.
RBAC/autenticação e E2E Mongo/WebSocket continuam pendentes.
end note
@enduml
